@startuml all
title Onto-Magic: the core ontology (v1.0, 23 September 2026)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members

abstract class TheAll <<open>> {
  .. Be-Ness ..
  (Abstract Space x Abstract Motion) ^ Absolute
  .. three aspects of the Absolute ..
  Abstract Space
  Abstract Motion
  Duration
}
note right of TheAll
  The formula names two of the
  three aspects. Where Duration
  sits in it is open, as is how
  any of it is expressed here.
end note

abstract class Monad <<deferred>>
abstract class Atmic <<deferred>>
abstract class Buddhic <<deferred>>

interface Creator {
  + createField() : Field
}
note right of Creator
  Only Creators can create Fields,
  and by extension realities.
end note

class Soul {
  + createField() : Field
}

class HigherSelf <<deferred>>

class Self {
  - innerBeing : Field
  - allowance : Allowance
  + reality : Reflection
  + believe(b : Belief)
  + drop() : Belief
}

class Field {
  - maker : Creator
}
note bottom of Field
  The surface a Reflection lands on.
end note

class Allowance {
  - beliefs : Deque<Belief>
  + push(b : Belief)
  + pop() : Belief
  + totalAmplitude() : int
}
note bottom of Allowance
  A set of beliefs: what you
  are allowed to experience.
end note

class Belief {
  - frequency : Frequency
  - amplitude : int
  + reinforce(t : Thought)
}
note bottom of Belief
  Holds one frequency unchanging.
  Amplitude is energy, not size.
end note

class Frequency
class Thought

class Reflection {
  - field : Field
  - allowance : Allowance
  + shareOf(b : Belief) : double
}
note bottom of Reflection
  All beliefs present at once,
  weighted by amplitude, composited
  like layers. Inner being is
  reflected in reality.
end note

interface Mental <<open>> {
  .. mind, consciousness ..
  .. awareness, thinking, cognition ..
}
note right of Mental
  Inherited by Self from a superclass.
  Which rung is open.
end note

TheAll <|-- Monad
Monad <|-- Atmic
Atmic <|-- Buddhic
Buddhic <|-- Soul
Creator <|.. Soul
Soul <|-- HigherSelf
HigherSelf <|-- Self

Soul ..> Field : creates
Self *-- Field : inner being
Self *-- Allowance : holds
Self *-- Reflection : reality
Reflection --> Field : reflects onto
Reflection --> Allowance : reflects
Allowance o-- Belief : set of
Belief --> Frequency : holds unchanging
Thought ..> Belief : reinforces

@enduml
